  "notes": "Run in an isolated scratch world with protocol777 observer. near/distant each receive one global event at (24,80,24)/(-2,82,-2); charging/NoAI/active receive none. With global_sound_events false, near receives one local event at (24,80,24) and distant (>64 blocks) receives none. Commands alone do not validate sound packets or rendered audio. Silent boss setup is excluded because current Pumpkin does not read Silent from entity NBT; its existing in-memory sound gate is unchanged and not live-tested here. Two settling ticks after teleport update observer tracking before spawning."
